WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.095
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:32.365 --> 00:39.330
FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS

3
00:58.266 --> 00:59.476
What are you doing here?

4
01:06.107 --> 01:06.941
Choi Jeong-yo.

5
01:10.570 --> 01:12.030
Just give me another shot.

6
01:12.113 --> 01:13.865
N N

7
01:15.366 --> 01:16.201
The solo…

8
01:18.078 --> 01:19.454
You've got to let me do it…

9
01:24.250 --> 01:25.293
I'll never do that.

10
01:29.005 --> 01:30.131
That piece was written

11
01:31.174 --> 01:33.051
out of your hatred for me, wasn't it?

12
01:34.135 --> 01:35.136
Do you really think…

13
01:35.804 --> 01:37.806
that anyone else could play it but me?

14
01:42.977 --> 01:44.145
I'd like… to thank you.

15
01:45.438 --> 01:47.649
Because going through this, I realized my own limitations.

16
01:47.732 --> 01:48.566
But…

17
01:49.067 --> 01:50.443
when it comes to "Nemesis",

18
01:51.778 --> 01:54.405
I'm the only one who can do it justice.

19
01:55.573 --> 01:57.367
Who the hell do you think you are?

20
01:59.452 --> 02:00.286
Huh?

21
02:01.704 --> 02:03.623
Nemesis is my composition.

22
02:04.707 --> 02:06.292
You're just a performer.

23
02:06.376 --> 02:08.711
You're nothing more than a tool for me to use.

24
02:10.046 --> 02:13.091
And it's up to me to choose which tool is best for the work.

25
02:13.174 --> 02:14.050
It's not.

26
02:16.136 --> 02:19.472
Nemesis was meant for me from the moment you wrote the first note.

27
02:20.140 --> 02:21.391
I just need to master it.

28
02:22.100 --> 02:24.102
Then the piece will finally be complete.

29
02:35.488 --> 02:37.157
This is your chance to finish it.

30
02:37.657 --> 02:39.325
Don't let revenge get in the way.

31
02:41.202 --> 02:42.704
Cut the bullshit and get lost.

32
02:43.538 --> 02:46.040
You don't have the right nor the skill to play it.

33
03:21.409 --> 03:26.289
FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS

34
03:27.707 --> 03:29.083
EPISODE 11

35
03:29.167 --> 03:31.127
LETTER OF APPOINTMENT KANG JI-HYE

36
03:37.842 --> 03:39.761
HYUN-SOO

37
03:39.844 --> 03:41.304
Take your time. I've arrived.

38
03:50.355 --> 03:51.773
INCOMING CALL HAN HYUN-JEONG

39
03:54.859 --> 03:55.777
Hey, Ji-hye.

40
03:56.319 --> 03:57.487
Are you feeling better?

41
03:58.279 --> 03:59.113
Yes, I'm fine.

42
04:00.406 --> 04:02.116
I was so worried, you know.

43
04:02.200 --> 04:04.160
You didn't pick up any of my calls.

44
04:04.244 --> 04:05.286
What do you want?

45
04:05.912 --> 04:07.997
Oh, um, I just wanted to talk.

46
04:08.957 --> 04:10.667
It's about Pi-o's contract renewal.

47
04:10.750 --> 04:12.669
Things aren't good at the company,

48
04:12.752 --> 04:14.754
so I think we'll need to reconsider.

49
04:16.047 --> 04:17.715
I'm going to need an explanation.

50
04:19.175 --> 04:21.135
Ah, I'll just be honest with you, okay?

51
04:21.761 --> 04:25.223
We took a huge financial hit when that album recording fell through.

52
04:25.765 --> 04:28.393
Up until now, we just wrote it off as a rough patch.

53
04:28.893 --> 04:30.895
But now that the album's fallen through too,

54
04:30.979 --> 04:32.897
there's a lot of talk at the company.

55
04:33.606 --> 04:35.817
So I don't think we can renew his contract.

56
04:36.317 --> 04:39.445
It's better if you hear it from me than from Pi-o himself, right?

57
04:39.529 --> 04:40.571
Han Hyun-jeong.

58
04:41.781 --> 04:43.408
How could you do this to me now?

59
04:44.325 --> 04:45.326
You saw it yourself.

60
04:45.827 --> 04:48.746
Choi Jeong-yo did all of that on purpose to mess with Pi-o.

61
04:48.830 --> 04:51.582
Oh, Ji-hye, I really don't know, you know?

62
04:52.625 --> 04:55.211
Anyway, there's - no point in talking about it.

63
04:55.295 --> 04:57.046
It'll just upset us both further.

64
04:57.797 --> 05:00.717
Gosh, Honestly, I feel terrible that it's come to this.

65
05:01.217 --> 05:03.845
Uh, my team will call Pi-o directly to go over the details,

66
05:03.928 --> 05:05.638
so just a heads-up to let him know.

67
05:05.722 --> 05:06.931
I'll call again, 'kay?

68
05:13.229 --> 05:14.981
Mom, what was that call regarding?

69
05:16.607 --> 05:18.776
Oh… You heard what I said, didn't you?

70
05:20.361 --> 05:22.363
How could you even consider doing that?

71
05:23.531 --> 05:25.450
You know the state of mind he's in, right now.

72
05:25.533 --> 05:28.411
You want us to be the first to turn our backs on him?

73
05:28.494 --> 05:30.663
If we refuse to renew his contract over this,

74
05:30.747 --> 05:33.833
what artist is ever going to trust us enough to sign with us?

75
05:33.916 --> 05:37.754
Isn't it our job as a management agency to stand by our artists?

76
05:38.254 --> 05:39.672
You should stay out of this.

77
05:40.381 --> 05:42.800
Something… feels off about them.

78
05:43.676 --> 05:46.262
Remember? When Jeong-yo went missing?

79
05:46.346 --> 05:49.098
There were whispers that Pi-o was somehow behind it.

80
05:50.391 --> 05:51.851
Oh come on, you believe that?

81
05:52.810 --> 05:55.480
There's no way Pi-o could've done a thing like that.

82
05:55.563 --> 05:57.732
You may not know him as well as you think.

83
05:58.858 --> 06:00.443
Where's your self-respect?

84
06:00.526 --> 06:03.863
You followed him around like a lovesick puppy, and he dumped you anyway.

85
06:03.946 --> 06:07.200
Ugh, I already hate his guts for breaking your heart like that!

86
06:07.283 --> 06:09.535
Besides, with his questionable past and bleak future,

87
06:09.619 --> 06:11.162
what is there left to defend?

88
06:16.125 --> 06:16.959
I can't do it.

89
06:18.836 --> 06:19.670
I won't do it.

90
06:22.131 --> 06:24.384
Look, I know what you're going to say.

91
06:24.467 --> 06:27.678
But if I turn myself in while Pi-o is in the state that he's in,

92
06:27.762 --> 06:28.596
how will he…

93
06:29.722 --> 06:30.807
get back on his feet?

94
06:32.433 --> 06:34.936
Everyone's already cutting ties with him as it is.

95
06:36.312 --> 06:38.523
If you terminate Pi-o's contract, I'm out.

96
06:38.606 --> 06:40.483
I'll quit the company as well.

97
06:40.566 --> 06:41.401
Consider that.

98
06:44.028 --> 06:47.073
Oh my God, how can you how can you be such a fool!

99
06:48.032 --> 06:48.866
Ji-hye.

100
06:49.951 --> 06:51.744
The longer you put this off,

101
06:51.828 --> 06:53.538
the harder it is to make it right.

102
06:54.872 --> 06:56.749
You need to be strong, for everyone…

103
06:56.833 --> 06:57.875
but especially…

104
06:58.709 --> 06:59.627
do for your sake.

105
07:00.211 --> 07:01.838
I know, I already know all that.

106
07:03.631 --> 07:05.007
Give me a little more time.

107
07:07.218 --> 07:08.636
Just wait a tiny bit longer.

108
07:22.567 --> 07:25.153
CHOI JEONG-YO

109
07:25.236 --> 07:27.989
We need to talk. I'll go to your office. Choi Jeong-yo,

110
07:32.785 --> 07:34.245
So, what brings you by today?

111
07:35.121 --> 07:35.955
Choi Jeong-yo,

112
07:36.539 --> 07:37.457
be honest with me.

113
07:38.666 --> 07:40.626
You're doing this to Pi-o on purpose.

114
07:41.502 --> 07:42.920
What do you mean by that?

115
07:43.004 --> 07:43.921
You're doing this

116
07:44.005 --> 07:47.049
cos you heard that Pi-o might've been involved in your kidnapping.

117
07:47.133 --> 07:49.343
If so, stop it right now. Cos it's not true.

118
07:50.470 --> 07:51.512
Hmm…

119
07:52.388 --> 07:53.848
How can you be so sure?

120
07:54.765 --> 07:55.600
So I'm right.

121
07:56.767 --> 07:57.977
That's why you did this.

122
07:59.520 --> 08:00.354
Look.

123
08:00.897 --> 08:01.731
Seriously.

124
08:02.398 --> 08:05.485
I've known the two of you longer and better than anyone else.

125
08:06.402 --> 08:07.695
Pi-o was the only one

126
08:08.321 --> 08:11.782
who kept searching the world for you. Even after everyone else gave up,

127
08:11.866 --> 08:13.159
he kept looking.

128
08:13.826 --> 08:14.785
So how could you

129
08:15.786 --> 08:16.704
let a rumor…

130
08:17.371 --> 08:19.707
let you believe the worst about a good friend?

131
08:21.709 --> 08:24.295
And isn't it possible that he wasn't actually searching for me,

132
08:24.378 --> 08:26.714
but was trying to make sure I was dead instead?

133
08:26.797 --> 08:28.382
Wow, Choi Jeong-yo.

134
08:30.718 --> 08:32.303
I'm really disappointed in you.

135
08:33.137 --> 08:34.889
When Pi-o heard that you were dead,

136
08:35.389 --> 08:38.476
he was so shocked he couldn't get out of bed for days.

137
08:38.559 --> 08:40.728
And I had to fly all the way to Moldova to get him.

138
08:40.811 --> 08:43.898
You'd been missing for ten years, when he heard you were dead.

139
08:43.981 --> 08:45.983
He couldn't even take a sip of water.

140
08:47.318 --> 08:48.194
So how could you…

141
08:59.163 --> 08:59.997
Forget it.

142
09:00.540 --> 09:03.417
What more can I say to someone who's using their amnesia

143
09:03.918 --> 09:05.169
as a way to hurt someone.

144
09:08.130 --> 09:08.965
In any case,

145
09:10.466 --> 09:12.468
if you keep going after Pi-o like this…

146
09:12.552 --> 09:14.387
I won't just sit back and watch.

147
09:14.470 --> 09:15.513
You've been warned.

148
09:32.321 --> 09:34.699
Why don't you answer? When are we going public?

149
09:38.369 --> 09:39.287
Just wait.

150
09:40.079 --> 09:40.913
Put it on hold.

151
10:00.808 --> 10:01.976
Music that moves people,

152
10:02.059 --> 10:05.396
deeply in their hearts is music that carries a lifetime within it.

153
10:09.442 --> 10:12.737
Your desire to make music even if you had only one day to live.

154
10:12.820 --> 10:14.071
Your very life.

155
10:14.572 --> 10:15.865
Put that into your music.

156
10:30.379 --> 10:31.213
And right here!

157
10:32.256 --> 10:35.468
I used marcato to capture the emotions of betrayal and revenge.

158
10:35.551 --> 10:36.761
But…

159
10:38.137 --> 10:41.474
do you actually think your performance is conveying all of those emotions?

160
10:41.557 --> 10:42.808
No, not in the slightest!

161
10:49.273 --> 10:50.107
Mister Kang.

162
10:53.027 --> 10:56.113
I just wanted to remind you that we're meant to watch the violinist videos at

163
10:56.197 --> 10:58.866
three o'clock. In the second-floor conference room.

164
10:58.949 --> 10:59.909
Mm-hmm.

165
11:00.868 --> 11:01.702
Oh, one thing…

166
11:02.203 --> 11:04.246
my replacement as artistic director…

167
11:06.916 --> 11:08.167
Put that on hold for now.

168
11:10.544 --> 11:11.504
Yes, Of course.

169
11:15.549 --> 11:16.467
Is there a reason?

170
11:18.260 --> 11:20.346
Is… something bothering you?

171
11:21.347 --> 11:23.307
There's a few things I'd like to check.

172
11:24.725 --> 11:25.643
I'll need time.

173
11:28.020 --> 11:28.854
Right.

174
11:56.340 --> 11:58.592
How are preparations going for the premiere?

175
12:02.012 --> 12:03.013
Yeah, well…

176
12:03.723 --> 12:05.599
I might be worried over nothing,

177
12:06.726 --> 12:10.062
but a conductor mustn't treat musicians as mere tools to be used…

178
12:11.605 --> 12:15.609
The performance belongs to the musicians on stage, not the conductor.

179
12:16.527 --> 12:19.447
Only when you realize that will you create great music.

180
12:23.075 --> 12:25.703
I've been meaning to ask you something for a while.

181
12:27.371 --> 12:28.497
Mister Kang…

182
12:29.665 --> 12:30.499
Do you

183
12:30.583 --> 12:34.628
believe that a morally flawed artist is fundamentally unworthy of creating art?

184
12:34.712 --> 12:37.631
Or do you think art and the artist's private life should be

185
12:37.715 --> 12:38.716
judged separately?

186
12:39.508 --> 12:40.593
Can you clarify?

187
12:41.260 --> 12:42.094
Well, art…

188
12:43.429 --> 12:46.056
is supposed to be a reflection of the artist's life.

189
12:47.224 --> 12:50.102
So if an artist commits a crime that is unforgivable…

190
12:50.936 --> 12:54.106
should society still accept their work without any reservation?

191
12:54.857 --> 12:56.442
I guess it's an age-old debate.

192
12:57.193 --> 13:00.446
Are you trying to playact at being a judge, or are you in fact trying to

193
13:00.529 --> 13:01.614
make some music here?

194
13:06.410 --> 13:07.286
I do not think an

195
13:07.369 --> 13:11.040
artist's sins will either pollute or corrupt the music that they create.

196
13:12.541 --> 13:16.587
In fact, I believe that one must be intrinsically flawed to create great art.

197
13:17.880 --> 13:19.590
What we should be wary of…

198
13:20.883 --> 13:24.553
is using our art as an excuse to commit evil acts without remorse.

199
13:26.180 --> 13:29.767
To punish and judge a flawed, imperfect artist is not our place at all.

200
13:30.935 --> 13:34.188
Ultimately, an artist who has committed unforgivable sins

201
13:34.271 --> 13:38.526
will face punishment for as long as the music they produced lives on.

202
13:39.443 --> 13:41.654
Do you think an eternity of judgment…

203
13:42.696 --> 13:44.156
Is a blessing or a curse?

204
13:53.499 --> 13:54.375
I'm sorry.

205
13:54.458 --> 13:56.168
I had to take an urgent call.

206
13:56.252 --> 14:00.005
So… shall we go through the applications first before reviewing the clips?

207
14:00.089 --> 14:01.215
Yes, let's do that.

208
14:16.480 --> 14:18.732
Gosh, it's so hard to find the right person.

209
14:19.525 --> 14:22.152
Even though they're all winners of prestigious competitions,

210
14:22.236 --> 14:23.612
none of them quite fit the…

211
15:08.949 --> 15:10.367
The tension you wanted…

212
15:11.827 --> 15:12.912
IS that more like it?

213
15:14.538 --> 15:15.372
N

214
15:15.998 --> 15:16.916
ENSEMBLE ROOM

215
15:16.999 --> 15:18.250
What are you doing here?

216
15:19.251 --> 15:22.212
I'm sorry for letting myself in without your permission.

217
15:22.963 --> 15:26.091
I knew you wouldn't change your mind unless you saw for yourself

218
15:26.175 --> 15:28.010
how much my playing has changed.

219
15:28.093 --> 15:30.179
This isn't going to change anything.

220
15:30.262 --> 15:31.388
What'd ya think?

221
15:32.389 --> 15:34.016
Did you not like my performance?

222
15:34.934 --> 15:36.060
Just admit it already.

223
15:36.602 --> 15:38.938
I'm the only one who can do this piece justice

224
15:39.605 --> 15:40.940
You know that's the truth.

225
16:31.907 --> 16:32.741
Oh…

226
16:37.454 --> 16:38.789
So, I've had this feeling…

227
16:40.040 --> 16:40.874
Uh…

228
16:41.625 --> 16:44.294
You have another performer in mind to play your piece.

229
16:44.378 --> 16:45.254
Isn't that right?

230
16:47.339 --> 16:50.092
-Sorry? -I'm just speaking from experience.

231
16:50.175 --> 16:54.638
Every premiere seems to have a performer who's destined to play it.

232
16:55.180 --> 16:56.015
And…

233
16:56.557 --> 16:58.350
something tells me it's not me.

234
16:58.434 --> 17:00.102
And if that's really the case…

235
17:00.644 --> 17:01.520
you should choose

236
17:02.187 --> 17:03.188
the person you want.

237
17:04.398 --> 17:06.233
-What are you-- -You're a composer.

238
17:07.026 --> 17:09.778
You should do whatever it take for your piece to shine.

239
17:24.543 --> 17:26.253
I'm just speaking from experience.

240
17:26.336 --> 17:30.716
Every premiere seems to have a performer who's destined to play it.

241
17:35.554 --> 17:36.680
Just admit it already.

242
17:38.098 --> 17:40.476
I'm the only one who can do this piece justice.

243
17:41.060 --> 17:42.394
You know that's the truth.

244
17:43.687 --> 17:44.521
Hey Mister Choi…

245
17:53.405 --> 17:54.490
Who the hell are you?

246
17:55.991 --> 17:57.993
Uh well, I'm uh…

247
18:00.120 --> 18:01.497
You don't need to ask that.

248
18:01.997 --> 18:03.248
You know who I am, right?

249
18:09.421 --> 18:10.798
What is it you want to say?

250
18:11.298 --> 18:13.008
You don't have to pretend with me.

251
18:14.259 --> 18:16.512
You see, I met Kang Pi-o's mom the other day.

252
18:18.097 --> 18:19.932
And, uh… she seems to be all right.

253
18:22.017 --> 18:23.936
I suppose you're looking for revenge…

254
18:24.019 --> 18:25.104
Aren't ya?

255
18:25.187 --> 18:26.105
Though, uh…

256
18:26.605 --> 18:29.608
Ya can't be half-assed about it, if you really wanna get it.

257
18:30.400 --> 18:33.987
If you're gonna take someone down, do it right and crush them completely!

258
18:34.071 --> 18:35.614
Let everyone know you did.

259
18:35.697 --> 18:36.949
They'll leave you alone.

260
18:38.575 --> 18:39.409
Want my help?

261
18:47.501 --> 18:49.628
You're still living like a dog, aren't ya?

262
18:51.463 --> 18:53.090
Who said you could go after him?

263
18:54.133 --> 18:56.218
No one touches him but me, is that clear?

264
18:57.010 --> 18:59.221
If you dare to lay a finger on Kang Pi-o,

265
18:59.763 --> 19:02.015
I'll make sure you don't breathe another day.

266
19:02.099 --> 19:03.267
You got that?

267
19:08.897 --> 19:09.731
Ouch…

268
19:10.440 --> 19:11.650
You busted my wrist.

269
19:12.317 --> 19:13.193
Hospital fee?

270
19:18.490 --> 19:19.324
Dude…

271
19:21.034 --> 19:22.703
I say "Kang Pio" and you go nuts.

272
19:23.620 --> 19:25.038
You've gotten ruthless, man.

273
19:25.789 --> 19:26.623
See ya around.

274
19:29.042 --> 19:30.002
Good luck, punk.

275
19:32.921 --> 19:34.673
N

276
19:35.257 --> 19:36.341
N

277
19:58.947 --> 19:59.781
Come outside.

278
20:00.574 --> 20:01.408
I'm out front.

279
20:09.583 --> 20:11.460
Do it. The show.

280
20:12.419 --> 20:15.088
I don't want you to think this means I've forgiven you.

281
20:15.172 --> 20:16.298
I'm just doing this…

282
20:17.132 --> 20:19.468
because I need Nemesis to be played perfectly.

283
20:36.777 --> 20:38.487
I know. I got really good seats!

284
22:09.828 --> 22:11.830
Good evening, everyone. I'm Yoon Seon-ju,

285
22:11.913 --> 22:14.249
president of the Hankook Symphony Orchestra.

286
22:14.833 --> 22:17.711
Thank you all for joining us at this festival celebrating

287
22:17.794 --> 22:19.504
the eightieth anniversary of…

288
22:20.380 --> 22:21.965
the Hankook Symphony Orchestra…

289
22:37.105 --> 22:40.484
I hope this will be an occasion we all remember for years to come.

290
22:40.567 --> 22:41.985
And now, may the show begin.

291
25:20.268 --> 25:22.103
Do you think I even care about your opinion?

292
25:22.187 --> 25:24.397
Yeah. You will never beat me.

293
25:29.402 --> 25:32.030
You chase after it, and there it is in the distance.

294
25:32.113 --> 25:34.950
Chase after it again, and it's farther out of reach.

295
25:35.450 --> 25:38.662
Even so, do you still want to take this windy, thorny path?

296
25:40.872 --> 25:42.624
Say you had less than a month to live,

297
25:42.707 --> 25:46.086
would you still want to keep playing the piano till the very end?

298
25:49.464 --> 25:51.925
The piano is the one thing that brings me joy.

299
25:52.592 --> 25:54.094
If I had one day left to live…

300
25:54.636 --> 25:56.555
I would still want to play the piano.

301
26:31.381 --> 26:33.758
Command the stage with your own energy.

302
26:34.634 --> 26:36.261
If your energy is strong enough,

303
26:36.344 --> 26:40.890
you can pull the entire orchestra and the conductor into your own world.

304
28:16.736 --> 28:17.987
You were right all along.

305
28:19.906 --> 28:22.075
This piece was meant for you and you alone.

306
29:56.586 --> 29:59.422
I would like to sincerely thank you all for coming.

307
29:59.506 --> 30:01.549
I'm truly grateful for your support.

308
30:01.633 --> 30:03.384
It was an absolute honor

309
30:03.968 --> 30:05.929
for me to perform Nemesis for you.

310
30:06.679 --> 30:08.932
Conductor Choi Jeong-yo's masterpiece.

311
30:11.476 --> 30:12.310
However…

312
30:14.270 --> 30:15.647
I've come out on stage…

313
30:17.440 --> 30:18.900
to make a confession tonight.

314
30:24.823 --> 30:25.657
The truth is…

315
30:28.576 --> 30:30.912
I don't deserve to be standing up here today.

316
30:33.206 --> 30:34.123
Nine years ago…

317
30:35.625 --> 30:38.795
You may recall a kidnapping at the Prague Harmonie Competition.

318
30:40.880 --> 30:44.008
The one who ordered the kidnapping of Choi Jeong-yo back then…

319
30:48.304 --> 30:49.138
was…

320
30:49.931 --> 30:50.765
myself.

321
30:58.189 --> 30:59.065
As a result,

322
31:00.316 --> 31:01.943
I have enjoyed undeserved glory.

323
31:03.027 --> 31:04.946
I've basked in it for nearly a decade.

324
31:07.782 --> 31:10.910
I offer my sincerest apologies to Conductor Choi Jeong-yo.

325
31:12.287 --> 31:14.289
He endured years of suffering cos of me.

326
31:15.540 --> 31:16.708
As of this moment,

327
31:17.917 --> 31:21.087
I intend to walk away from all the privileges I have been given

328
31:21.170 --> 31:22.672
and accept the punishment I deserve.

329
31:22.755 --> 31:26.050
To everyone who has supported me all these years…

330
31:27.468 --> 31:28.553
I apologize to you.

331
31:32.348 --> 31:34.225
I'm sorry for letting you all down.

332
31:43.401 --> 31:45.028
Seriously? This is unbelievable.

333
32:09.385 --> 32:10.678
Wait, what just happened?

334
32:16.142 --> 32:16.976
Why you…

335
32:18.394 --> 32:20.480
What the hell do you think you're doing?

336
32:20.563 --> 32:21.689
I'm sorry.

337
32:22.982 --> 32:23.900
And thank you too.

338
32:25.109 --> 32:26.277
It took me until today…

339
32:28.279 --> 32:29.656
to truly understand you.

340
32:30.573 --> 32:32.533
What the hell does that MEAN!??

341
32:32.617 --> 32:33.576
Mister Kang Pi-o?

342
32:35.161 --> 32:36.496
I'm Inspector Han Sang-gu

343
32:36.579 --> 32:38.915
from the Major Crimes Investigation Unit.

344
32:39.707 --> 32:42.335
We've some questions. Would you come with us please?

345
32:48.341 --> 32:49.175
Uh,

346
32:49.258 --> 32:50.843
Wait, I think there's been a misunderstanding.

347
32:50.927 --> 32:51.886
Just wait a moment.

348
32:51.970 --> 32:55.640
Hold on. Pi-o, tell me what's going on right now! Is it really true?

349
32:55.723 --> 32:56.933
Pi-o! Pi-o, WAIT!

350
32:57.433 --> 32:58.393
Just wait, please!

351
32:58.476 --> 32:59.519
Let him explain!

352
32:59.602 --> 33:00.645
Please wait Officers!

353
33:00.728 --> 33:02.063
Who knew Kang Pi-o would be the one

354
33:02.146 --> 33:04.816
-behind it all along? -Hey, so he really was arrested?

355
33:04.899 --> 33:06.859
-Guess he really did it. -Guess he did.

356
33:20.915 --> 33:22.166
-Kang Pi-o? Why? -Oh my gosh!

357
33:22.250 --> 33:24.210
What's going on? Is that for real?

358
33:24.293 --> 33:26.421
Quick look it up on your phone. Oh it is true!

359
33:26.504 --> 33:29.090
KANG PI-O CONFESSES TO INVOLVEMENT IN CHOI JEONG-YO'S DISAPPEARANCE

360
33:29.966 --> 33:32.093
-No he did, go on check another site, -I can't believe it! He couldn't have!

361
33:32.176 --> 33:33.011
Check the news.

362
33:33.094 --> 33:34.971
CALLING… KANG JI-HYE

363
33:42.353 --> 33:44.355
Why isn't she picking up the phone?

364
33:48.818 --> 33:50.653
Oh. Excuse me, Officer?

365
33:51.195 --> 33:53.239
Where is the Pianist, Kang Pi-o, being held right now?

366
33:53.322 --> 33:54.949
Oh, he's being interviewed.

367
33:55.033 --> 33:56.159
So you can't see him.

368
34:00.538 --> 34:02.582
Please let me see the detective in charge.

369
34:02.665 --> 34:04.208
I'll explain everything.

370
34:04.292 --> 34:05.543
I'm the one who did it.

371
34:06.085 --> 34:07.211
It was all me you see?

372
34:07.295 --> 34:08.713
My son is innocent, Officer.

373
34:09.422 --> 34:11.340
I understand what you're saying, ma'am,

374
34:11.424 --> 34:13.342
but he's being interviewed right now,

375
34:13.426 --> 34:14.719
so you can't see him.

376
34:14.802 --> 34:16.012
Please go home for now.

377
34:17.055 --> 34:19.223
When they are finished… You can request to see him.

378
34:19.307 --> 34:20.975
-But I did it. -Ah, sure.

379
34:21.059 --> 34:22.685
I'm the one you should arrest! Detective!

380
34:22.769 --> 34:23.644
Ms. Kang.

381
34:23.728 --> 34:24.562
Jae-in.

382
34:26.105 --> 34:27.231
What am I going to do?

383
34:28.066 --> 34:28.900
You know, right?

384
34:29.525 --> 34:30.485
You know the truth.

385
34:31.569 --> 34:33.488
Pi-o didn't do it. I swear, he didn't!

386
34:34.238 --> 34:35.073
It was all…

387
34:37.366 --> 34:38.659
-It was… all me… -Oh!

388
34:58.346 --> 34:59.222
Wanna grab a bite?

389
34:59.305 --> 35:00.181
Oh, er, I'm sorry,

390
35:00.264 --> 35:01.390
So we calling this a date, or…

391
35:01.474 --> 35:03.059
but I can't let you meet with the suspect alone.

392
35:03.142 --> 35:04.435
Call it whatever you want…

393
35:04.519 --> 35:05.686
-It's not allowed. -No.

394
35:07.480 --> 35:08.815
Please, I need to see him.

395
35:12.610 --> 35:15.154
Um Just a moment. Wait here.

396
35:27.750 --> 35:28.709
What are you doing?

397
35:31.921 --> 35:32.755
You…

398
35:36.008 --> 35:37.885
You ruined everything. You know that?

399
35:39.929 --> 35:43.599
Do you have any idea what it took for me just to hold on all these years?

400
35:45.059 --> 35:45.893
Do you…

401
35:48.729 --> 35:51.315
Do you really think this is how I wanted it to end?

402
35:52.733 --> 35:55.528
I was supposed to be the one to judge you, and if you died I was meant to

403
35:55.611 --> 35:56.988
have killed you, so WHY!!!???

404
35:57.071 --> 35:57.905
I'm sorry.

405
35:59.240 --> 36:01.742
This was the best that I could do and you know it…

406
36:03.452 --> 36:06.539
You're far too talented an artist to waste your time on this.

407
36:07.623 --> 36:09.959
Your quest for revenge will destroy your soul.

408
36:11.460 --> 36:13.296
Stop using your hate to make music…

409
36:15.756 --> 36:17.008
and make it for yourself.

410
36:19.677 --> 36:20.970
Okay, it's time to go Mister Choi!

411
36:21.053 --> 36:22.763
-Who are you to tell me that? -Time to leave!

412
36:22.847 --> 36:23.681
Calm down!

413
36:23.764 --> 36:25.391
Who do you think you are lecturing me? Damn it!

414
36:25.474 --> 36:27.602
-You need to leave, now! -Come on, let's step outside.

415
36:27.685 --> 36:29.020
What gives you the right?!

416
36:42.450 --> 36:44.619
INCOMING CALL HYUN-CHUL

417
36:45.661 --> 36:46.495
Shit…

418
36:47.413 --> 36:48.247
Where are you?

419
36:48.331 --> 36:49.624
HYUN-CHUL WHERE R U?

420
36:50.208 --> 36:51.626
MISSED CALL HYUN-CHUL

421
37:12.396 --> 37:14.148
Did the police say anything to you?

422
37:16.442 --> 37:17.276
It's not true.

423
37:19.278 --> 37:21.155
There's been a mistake, hasn't there?

424
37:22.031 --> 37:22.949
No, it's not true…

425
37:24.867 --> 37:25.910
Pi-o didn't do it.

426
37:27.078 --> 37:29.413
Then why would Pi-o say something like that?

427
37:30.748 --> 37:31.916
Because I did it.

428
37:36.379 --> 37:37.797
Just what are you saying?

429
37:39.257 --> 37:40.216
Pi-o didn't do it.

430
37:41.467 --> 37:43.261
Because I ordered the kidnapping.

431
37:49.892 --> 37:51.227
You're saying it was you?

432
37:52.311 --> 37:53.145
That's right.

433
37:53.646 --> 37:54.605
That's what I said!

434
37:55.439 --> 37:57.066
Pi-o was going to lose that day!

435
37:57.900 --> 37:59.360
So I made sure he would win!

436
38:00.820 --> 38:01.654
Are you…

437
38:04.156 --> 38:05.324
Are you even human?

438
38:06.075 --> 38:07.535
How could you do such a thing?

439
38:07.618 --> 38:09.203
What kind of monster are you?

440
38:10.746 --> 38:12.832
This whole mess is on you, you know that?

441
38:14.083 --> 38:17.837
If you had given more affection to Pi-o, I never would have had to do that.

442
38:18.796 --> 38:21.048
Dad, if you'd only accepted Pi-o as your grandson,

443
38:21.132 --> 38:23.342
I never would have done something that crazy!

444
38:23.426 --> 38:26.262
Why did you do that? Why did you do that to me?

445
38:26.345 --> 38:27.805
Why did you do that to Pi-o?!

446
38:27.888 --> 38:30.558
Why'd you do it!!? TELL ME

447
38:31.058 --> 38:32.518
Why did you do that…

448
38:36.188 --> 38:37.523
Why did you do that?

449
38:38.316 --> 38:39.275
Why, Daddy?

450
38:40.109 --> 38:41.569
Why did you do that?!

451
39:03.549 --> 39:04.383
I…

452
39:05.926 --> 39:07.136
came to turn myself in.

453
39:08.512 --> 39:09.764
I was the one who did it.

454
39:10.348 --> 39:11.849
My son knew nothing about it.

455
39:13.726 --> 39:15.394
He found out the truth recently.

456
39:16.479 --> 39:18.064
He's just trying to protect me…

457
39:19.857 --> 39:21.567
That's why he's turned himself in.

458
39:24.570 --> 39:26.322
You can check through Pi-o's phone.

459
39:27.865 --> 39:31.452
There's a photo of me meeting with the kidnapper when I paid him to do it.

460
39:31.535 --> 39:32.536
You should look for it.

461
39:32.620 --> 39:33.537
I'm sorry, ma'am…

462
39:34.622 --> 39:36.248
We checked Kang Pi-o's phone.

463
39:36.332 --> 39:38.167
We didn't find anything like that.

464
39:39.668 --> 39:41.462
-It was there… -Ma'am.

465
39:41.545 --> 39:42.755
Mister Kang Pi-o, uh…

466
39:43.964 --> 39:45.341
submitted conclusive evidence

467
39:45.424 --> 39:48.511
that he has been in continuous contact with the criminals that were behind the

468
39:48.594 --> 39:50.679
kidnapping. And recently,

469
39:51.764 --> 39:54.683
He withdrew… a large sum of money in Moldova…

470
39:55.518 --> 39:57.103
to hand over to the kidnappers.

471
39:59.897 --> 40:00.731
Um…

472
40:01.732 --> 40:03.359
I just want make one thing clear.

473
40:03.442 --> 40:06.404
There is no way that you can take the blame for your son's crime.

474
40:06.487 --> 40:08.739
So if you would- Please stop interfering…

475
40:09.490 --> 40:10.324
and go home.

476
40:11.200 --> 40:13.411
Believe me I swear, it was really me.

477
40:13.911 --> 40:14.995
Oh… Please.

478
40:15.496 --> 40:16.664
Please believe me!

479
40:17.915 --> 40:18.999
I was behind it!

480
40:33.055 --> 40:36.642
N N

481
40:42.773 --> 40:43.607
Jeong-yo.

482
40:45.192 --> 40:46.360
Will you forgive me?

483
40:48.612 --> 40:50.448
I was the one who had you kidnapped.

484
40:51.824 --> 40:52.992
Pi-o wasn't involved.

485
40:53.951 --> 40:56.412
I don't know, I must have lost my mind back then.

486
40:57.163 --> 40:59.165
I did such a disgusting thing to you.

487
41:01.750 --> 41:05.588
Pi-o didn't know anything about it and he only recently found out the truth.

488
41:06.964 --> 41:09.049
He wanted us to beg for your forgiveness.

489
41:10.092 --> 41:12.344
But I refused, and threatened to kill myself.

490
41:14.680 --> 41:16.182
That's why he didn't tell you.

491
41:18.350 --> 41:20.519
Even still, Pi-o still calls me his mother…

492
41:22.104 --> 41:25.149
And he has chosen to take the blame for everything that I've done.

493
41:25.232 --> 41:26.066
Jeong-yo.

494
41:27.234 --> 41:29.195
Could you testify to the police that…

495
41:30.279 --> 41:31.530
Pio didn't do it.

496
41:32.364 --> 41:34.742
That you remember that it was me that did it?

497
41:36.410 --> 41:37.786
I deserve your hatred…

498
41:38.621 --> 41:41.248
yet no matter how hard I try to think of another way

499
41:41.916 --> 41:43.584
I can't think of anyone else to ask for

500
41:43.667 --> 41:45.794
help but you, please help make this right.

501
41:47.296 --> 41:48.797
Let me bear the punishment.

502
41:49.548 --> 41:51.008
Please just save my son.

503
41:53.969 --> 41:56.096
Do you actually expect me to believe that?

504
42:00.142 --> 42:02.520
I understand that you want to protect your son,

505
42:04.563 --> 42:06.941
but why would you come here and ask this of me?

506
42:08.025 --> 42:10.945
Why would you ask the one whose life he ruined completely?

507
42:14.031 --> 42:14.865
N

508
42:14.949 --> 42:17.493
Please go home now, or I'll call the police.

509
42:17.576 --> 42:18.911
No! No, wait

510
42:19.495 --> 42:22.331
It's true. You have to believe me, Jeong-yo.

511
42:22.414 --> 42:23.624
IT was all my fault.

512
42:24.333 --> 42:26.043
It was all me. Pi-o,

513
42:26.126 --> 42:27.670
Pi-o didn't know anyth-- No!

514
42:28.170 --> 42:29.672
Jeong-yo! Jeong-yo! Jeong-yo!

515
42:29.755 --> 42:31.632
Jeong-yo! Jeong-yo!

516
42:32.758 --> 42:34.593
Jeong-yo, please listen to me.

517
42:36.345 --> 42:37.179
I'm sorry.

518
42:38.722 --> 42:39.682
I'm so sorry.

519
42:41.600 --> 42:43.310
I did you so wrong.

520
42:45.062 --> 42:46.522
Pi-o was your good friend.

521
42:47.606 --> 42:50.734
You can hate me all you want, but please don't hate Pi-o.

522
42:52.486 --> 42:53.320
Please…

523
42:57.658 --> 42:59.660
During your one-on-one with the suspect,

524
43:00.452 --> 43:01.662
you spoke to him

525
43:02.454 --> 43:04.748
as though you already knew that he was guilty.

526
43:04.832 --> 43:06.584
Was this actually the case?

527
43:07.334 --> 43:08.252
Did you know that?

528
43:09.169 --> 43:10.004
I'm sorry.

529
43:11.297 --> 43:12.256
And thank you too.

530
43:13.424 --> 43:14.592
It took me until today…

531
43:16.594 --> 43:18.012
to truly understand you.

532
43:18.971 --> 43:21.473
This was the best that I could do and you know it…

533
43:23.142 --> 43:26.353
You're far too talented an artist to waste your time on this.

534
43:26.437 --> 43:29.023
Your quest for revenge will destroy your soul.

535
43:30.441 --> 43:32.318
Stop using your hate to make music…

536
43:34.737 --> 43:35.988
and make it for yourself.

537
43:45.497 --> 43:46.332
No.

538
43:46.832 --> 43:47.666
No.

539
43:49.668 --> 43:51.170
I don't… remember.

540
43:53.130 --> 43:53.964
All right then,

541
43:54.465 --> 43:55.674
and everything you said?

542
43:56.175 --> 43:57.176
What was all that?

543
43:57.801 --> 44:00.012
About how Kang Pi-o ordered your kidnapping.

544
44:00.679 --> 44:01.513
I just…

545
44:07.227 --> 44:08.979
happened to hear a rumor about it.

546
44:41.470 --> 44:42.304
Mister Choi.

547
44:45.015 --> 44:45.849
Choi Jeong-yo?

548
44:54.566 --> 44:55.526
Hello, Mister Choi.

549
44:57.027 --> 44:59.655
I have something to tell you about Mister Kang Pi-o.

550
45:00.322 --> 45:01.699
Could we talk for a moment?

551
45:02.574 --> 45:03.659
Oh, you may not know who I am,

552
45:03.742 --> 45:06.578
Mister Choi, but I feel like I've known you for so long.

553
45:07.079 --> 45:09.248
I'm so happy to finally meet you in person.

554
45:10.082 --> 45:11.792
What is it you wanted to tell me?

555
45:11.875 --> 45:12.876
Well, you see…

556
45:14.628 --> 45:15.713
The truth is…

557
45:16.922 --> 45:19.842
Mister Kang did not arrange to have you kidnapped back then.

558
45:19.925 --> 45:22.511
In fact, he desperately hoped you were still alive.

559
45:24.221 --> 45:25.973
What are you talking about, Mister?

560
45:26.640 --> 45:28.100
Did you know that Mister Kang had been

561
45:28.183 --> 45:30.894
secretly searching for you for the last five years,?

562
45:30.978 --> 45:32.730
And I was the one looking into it.

563
45:34.356 --> 45:35.190
So what?

564
45:36.608 --> 45:37.776
How can you be sure he wasn't

565
45:37.860 --> 45:41.280
just checking to see if I was really dead or not, can you prove that?

566
45:41.363 --> 45:44.575
Cos I saw how he reacted when he heard that you had passed away.

567
45:45.617 --> 45:47.286
He was absolutely devastated.

568
45:49.371 --> 45:51.248
Did Ms. Kang tell you to look for me?

569
45:52.040 --> 45:55.002
Why the hell are you spinning such bullshit lies like that?

570
45:55.794 --> 45:59.381
Do I really look that stupid to you that I'd buy into this cheap trick?

571
46:03.135 --> 46:04.636
When we went to meet the gang,

572
46:05.929 --> 46:07.264
I had my recorder running.

573
46:14.104 --> 46:16.231
This contains Mister Kang's real feelings.

574
46:29.411 --> 46:32.539
Why did you kill him?

575
46:33.540 --> 46:34.750
Was it for money?

576
46:34.833 --> 46:36.919
Did you abduct him for that reason? Or did someone--

577
46:37.002 --> 46:38.045
Enough.

578
46:38.128 --> 46:39.171
You want to know?

579
46:40.130 --> 46:42.382
Three million lei. Then I'll tell you.

580
46:43.842 --> 46:44.718
[Struggles

581
46:45.219 --> 46:46.178
TELL ME!!!

582
46:46.261 --> 46:47.387
Mister Kang, don't!

583
46:48.013 --> 46:52.184
You killed him for something so small? You know who he was? He was my FRIEND!

584
46:52.267 --> 46:53.393
Come on, stop!

585
46:59.566 --> 47:00.901
Do you know who we are?

586
47:01.860 --> 47:02.736
You little…

587
47:03.570 --> 47:04.404
You know what?

588
47:05.280 --> 47:08.075
Now, six million.

589
47:08.158 --> 47:09.409
Then I'll tell you.

590
47:09.493 --> 47:12.412
And I also got to see you pay off another one of them.

591
47:12.496 --> 47:14.915
Is there an international bank close by here?

592
48:25.027 --> 48:27.988
CHOI JEONG-YO

593
48:32.910 --> 48:36.830
I'VE ALREADY MEMORIZED IT ALL USE IT IF YOU NEED IT!

594
48:36.914 --> 48:37.748
Come back,

595
48:38.582 --> 48:39.416
Jeong-yo.

596
49:26.171 --> 49:27.047
Kang Pi-o,

597
49:27.130 --> 49:28.048
come on out.

598
49:29.257 --> 49:30.425
You may go home now.

599
49:32.010 --> 49:33.762
What's the reason for releasing me?

600
49:34.554 --> 49:37.724
Did my mother turn herself in, claiming that she was behind it?

601
49:39.184 --> 49:40.644
Let me be very clear.

602
49:41.144 --> 49:44.356
She must have somehow fabricated evidence to show that she did it,

603
49:44.439 --> 49:45.482
but it's not true.

604
49:45.565 --> 49:47.818
Don't believe her, because I did it. So please…

605
49:47.901 --> 49:48.735
Um…

606
49:50.487 --> 49:52.322
That's enough, Kang Pi-o.

607
49:52.823 --> 49:55.367
We've reviewed all the evidence and that facts prove…

608
49:55.450 --> 49:57.077
that you are not the culprit.

609
49:58.912 --> 49:59.746
Besides that…

610
50:01.039 --> 50:03.417
The victim has testified that you didn't do it.

611
50:08.338 --> 50:11.341
Do you admit to arranging Mister Choi Jeong-yo's kidnapping?

612
50:12.676 --> 50:13.510
Yes.

613
50:14.386 --> 50:15.220
I admit to it.

614
50:16.471 --> 50:18.306
When did you meet the kidnappers?

615
50:19.182 --> 50:21.768
On March 18th, Two thousand seventeen…

616
50:22.644 --> 50:25.772
As I recall, I met with them near Wenceslas Square in Prague.

617
50:30.152 --> 50:32.529
SEOUL CENTRAL POLICE STATION

618
51:33.590 --> 51:34.424
Are you okay?

619
51:37.969 --> 51:39.429
I'm sorry, Pi-o.

620
51:40.430 --> 51:42.516
I had no idea what you were dealing with,

621
51:43.850 --> 51:45.602
and I just kept blaming you.

622
51:45.685 --> 51:46.645
Resenting you.

623
51:47.729 --> 51:48.563
But still…

624
51:49.689 --> 51:50.982
you should have told me.

625
51:51.858 --> 51:53.902
You didn't have to carry it on your own.

626
51:53.985 --> 51:55.237
I was there for you.

627
51:56.488 --> 51:58.323
I'm sorry, Jae-in…

628
52:00.700 --> 52:02.619
I'm sorry you had to see me like this.

629
52:13.630 --> 52:14.464
Kang Pi-o.

630
52:24.599 --> 52:25.433
Why'd'ya do it?

631
52:28.186 --> 52:29.271
I heard everything.

632
52:31.648 --> 52:33.567
I wish you would have told me sooner.

633
52:36.778 --> 52:37.904
Told me it wasn't you.

634
52:40.323 --> 52:42.492
You should've at least been honest with me.

635
52:43.910 --> 52:44.744
I'm sorry.

636
52:45.662 --> 52:46.496
You know…

637
52:49.291 --> 52:50.625
even if I didn't do it,

638
52:52.085 --> 52:54.171
I'd be lying if I said I never wanted to.

639
52:55.839 --> 52:57.340
Even if my mom hadn't done it,

640
52:59.676 --> 53:02.637
I would've wanted to get rid of you at some point, I guess.

641
53:04.681 --> 53:06.683
That's what it's like to be second-best.

642
53:36.129 --> 53:38.757
NEW BEGINNING STARTS HERE ESTABLISHING LAW AND ORDER

643
53:42.719 --> 53:43.637
Why did you do it?

644
53:44.387 --> 53:45.305
You tell me first.

645
53:46.514 --> 53:47.849
You made a fool out of me.

646
53:48.725 --> 53:50.310
Because it was all my fault.

647
53:51.895 --> 53:52.729
Um…

648
53:54.856 --> 53:57.817
I've always loved seeing you smile, ever since I was a kid.

649
53:58.818 --> 54:01.947
So I wanted to do whatever it took to make you smile.

650
54:03.323 --> 54:04.950
When I won the competition,

651
54:06.451 --> 54:09.287
you smiled brighter than I'd ever seen you smile before.

652
54:10.413 --> 54:11.248
And I thought…

653
54:12.999 --> 54:13.833
"This is it."

654
54:16.586 --> 54:18.755
"My mom is finally proud of me."

655
54:19.589 --> 54:21.091
"She's not ashamed of me…

656
54:23.051 --> 54:24.594
she's actually proud of me."

657
54:26.137 --> 54:27.138
In the end, I think…

658
54:28.598 --> 54:30.308
I'm the one who made you this way.

659
54:31.893 --> 54:32.727
Kang Pi-o.

660
54:36.481 --> 54:37.816
Don't you ever think that.

661
54:41.319 --> 54:43.655
It's all my fault. It has been from the start.

662
54:46.157 --> 54:48.326
People always used to look at me and laugh.

663
54:51.204 --> 54:53.039
But then my precious gem came along.

664
54:53.957 --> 54:54.791
I said…

665
54:54.874 --> 54:58.044
"The son I gave birth to is a gift from Heaven itself."

666
54:58.628 --> 55:00.255
"You can mock me all you want."

667
55:01.673 --> 55:04.134
"Your jeers are nothing but envy and jealousy."

668
55:05.385 --> 55:07.721
Through you I had the chance to show them all.

669
55:08.680 --> 55:10.932
That's why I was so hard on you all the time.

670
55:11.808 --> 55:14.436
And because you did as you were told without ever complaining,

671
55:14.519 --> 55:17.022
I kept pushing you even harder to become the best.

672
55:21.526 --> 55:22.360
I'm so sorry.

673
55:26.072 --> 55:28.533
I only wanted to help you with your music career,

674
55:29.534 --> 55:31.244
but I ended up getting in the way.

675
55:33.371 --> 55:34.998
You need forget about me now.

676
55:35.081 --> 55:36.958
Cut ties with me and go your own way.

677
55:38.084 --> 55:39.210
Go spread your wings.

678
55:40.545 --> 55:42.797
And only think about the music that you love.

679
55:47.802 --> 55:50.513
You must have been sick and tired of living as my son.

680
55:51.681 --> 55:53.141
Well, I'm just as sick of it.

681
55:56.269 --> 55:57.604
Sick of being your mother.

682
57:19.519 --> 57:21.146
Continuing from yesterday,

683
57:21.646 --> 57:24.566
we'll be rehearsing the Lacrimosa from Mozart's Requiem.

684
57:26.443 --> 57:27.610
As you know, this was…

685
57:28.862 --> 57:32.073
the last piece of music Mozart worked on before he died.

686
57:33.575 --> 57:35.535
And as though he foresaw his own death,

687
57:36.244 --> 57:37.287
Mozart filled -

688
57:37.370 --> 57:39.831
each and every note with a sense of foreboding.

689
57:42.834 --> 57:44.043
So, the violins should,

690
57:44.752 --> 57:46.546
as the name "Lacrimosa", suggests,

691
57:47.130 --> 57:50.133
They should sound like teardrops falling one by one.

692
57:51.759 --> 57:52.844
The chorus

693
57:53.344 --> 57:56.139
should take their time and then gradually build,

694
57:56.848 --> 57:59.309
like one slowly approaching the seat of judgment,

695
57:59.809 --> 58:03.563
with the tension rising carefully, steadily and with conviction.

696
58:30.256 --> 58:35.762
Full of tears

697
58:36.804 --> 58:41.935
Will be that day

698
58:42.018 --> 58:43.811
What are the details of your mother's crime?

699
58:43.895 --> 58:44.729
Isa it true she hired the kidnappers?

700
58:44.812 --> 58:45.647
When from the ashes

701
58:45.730 --> 58:47.815
--Since when did you know about the case… -Please say a few words.

702
58:47.899 --> 58:49.776
-Do you have any comment? -What will you do now?

703
58:49.859 --> 58:51.027
Will you play again?

704
58:51.110 --> 58:52.487
Shall arise

705
58:56.407 --> 59:03.122
The guilty man

706
59:03.206 --> 59:09.504
to be judged

707
59:10.171 --> 59:16.636
Full of tears

708
59:16.719 --> 59:22.183
Will be that day

709
59:22.976 --> 59:28.731
When from the ashes

710
59:29.566 --> 59:35.113
Shall arise

711
59:35.613 --> 59:42.579
The guilty man

712
59:42.662 --> 59:48.751
to be judged

713
59:49.252 --> 59:56.217
Therefore spare him,

714
59:58.970 --> 01:00:02.015
O God

715
01:00:02.098 --> 01:00:08.521
Merciful Lord

716
01:00:08.605 --> 01:00:09.731
Lord Jesus

717
01:00:09.814 --> 01:00:12.525
SPECIAL APPEARANCE BY KO CHANG-SEOK

718
01:00:32.962 --> 01:00:34.672
FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS

719
01:00:35.173 --> 01:00:38.885
I can't believe such a prominent family like his could unravel so quickly?

720
01:00:38.968 --> 01:00:41.179
This mean our little project's kaput now?

721
01:00:41.262 --> 01:00:42.305
I'm done for good.

722
01:00:42.930 --> 01:00:43.848
Everything.

723
01:00:44.515 --> 01:00:46.351
It all happened because of my greed.

724
01:00:47.018 --> 01:00:49.646
Come with me. I've something to show you.

725
01:00:49.729 --> 01:00:52.315
The only thing we can do now, is just keep making music.

726
01:00:52.815 --> 01:00:55.652
Just like that day. Freely.

727
01:00:55.735 --> 01:00:59.364
Jeong-yo, uh… sent in his resignation letter, and now I can't reach him.

728
01:01:00.239 --> 01:01:02.116
Just let me ask you this one favor…
